{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/8936cd4ce37ddb1947df6027d4614beb.avif?t=1760708778\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An Eastern hopping corpse that needs your blood to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/2bd87d1978cdc337ed298d99d4057f61.avif?t=1760708778\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A giant bug that\u2019s always calm and good at plotting, plus setting traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/9d2f02387a0b32075e31539b7cd1c385.avif?t=1760708778\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everyone, please add this to your wishlist and support this monster-themed action-adventure epic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everyone, please add this to your wishlist and support this monster-themed action-adventure epic!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2193\u2193There are even bigger monsters here\u2014<strong>like a spaceship made of flesh. It\u2019ll ask you to kill her.</strong>\u2193\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/3d82cb3b5cd8a42a792522bd11dfe6cb.avif?t=1760708778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras_big/3d82cb3b5cd8a42a792522bd11dfe6cb.webp?t=1760708778 width=1560 height=828 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you don\u2019t, she\u2019ll keep eating pretty girls~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/b10492102295810cbb89951e03c7b251.avif?t=1760708778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras_big/b10492102295810cbb89951e03c7b251.webp?t=1760708778 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tons of characters build this story\u2014from a living city to an other-dimensional rainforest, even spanning hundreds of millions of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/bf9a83980c2a89e8fb8a62df07844ba0.avif?t=1760708778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras_big/bf9a83980c2a89e8fb8a62df07844ba0.avif?t=1760708778 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/aaea04ae85cad1bcd4949f5473654d2d.avif?t=1760708778\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It started with a kiss, started with the breakdown of a beloved one, and is filled with intense battles.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the end, the story will reach a philosophical place, and show you a romantic, warm tale that breaks through dimension walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Devs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a narrative-driven game studio, creators of the indie game <i>GhostFeed</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inspired by epic stories like <i>Fate/stay night</i> and <i>Steins;Gate</i>, and deeply moved by <i>EVA</i>'s visual storytelling, we craft immersive worlds in this spirit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was developed using the Wansei Xingchen Editor, boosting our workflow efficiency. We hope you enjoy this new chapter.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668550?t=1760708778","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/6008d56434377795640a83f322772b452f5c2f95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760708778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/22a19c8d5935854a91c9447307e3ed25dae78529/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760708778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/22a19c8d5935854a91c9447307e3ed25dae78529/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760708778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3675440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/8936cd4ce37ddb1947df6027d4614beb.avif?t=1760708778\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An Eastern hopping corpse that needs your blood to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/2bd87d1978cdc337ed298d99d4057f61.avif?t=1760708778\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A giant 